<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hotel Shilla 1996 net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Hotel Shilla 1996 net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				 (loss) 6.77 vs   5.26 (profit)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 233.08 vs 248.83</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	common shares			  none vs   5</p>
<p>	preferred shares		     none vs   6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss/profit	   (loss) 6.75 vs   8.05 (profit)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both loss)	  0.54 vs   0.28</p>
<p>NOTE - Hotel Shilla Co, a unit of Samsung Group, said its share capital was unchanged at 18.99 million shares.</p>
</text>
